Package: buzzard-torrent
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Open Research Tools <maintainers@openresearchtools.org>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11)
Description: reusable qBittorrent service for Buzzard applications
 Provides the pinned qBittorrent/libtorrent runtime, JSON CLI, private WebUI
 service and stdio MCP interface for Wild Buzzard and other local clients.
